  - m_Id: 87807496347865088
    m_Localized: "Unlock <color=#77FFCD>Flee</color> and <color=#77FFCD>Evade</color>
      as combat actions.\n\n <color=#77FFCD>[Flee]</color>: Leave combat when you
      roll above the defender.\n\n <color=#77FFCD>[Evade]</color>: Ignore incoming
      damage when you roll above the attacker. Otherwise, take damage as if you rolled
      a 0."
